Package: fpcubeR
Title: Read the Florida Pasture Cube
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Hugo", "Rodrigues", email = "rodrigues.h@ufl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Downloads and reads the Florida Pasture Cube, a field-level data set of
    62,847 persistent pasture fields in Florida with 5-day composites of
    Harmonized Landsat and Sentinel-2 reflectance and indices, Sentinel-1
    backscatter and PRISM weather from 2016 to 2026, per-acquisition
    observation tables, and drought, pasture condition and hurricane labels.
    Functions select fields, read composites with gap-filled optical values
    removed by default, join the county drought class, compute anomalies
    against each field's own climatology and plot field time series.
